OL,3,APolice officer dies and another injured
OL,4,Aafter backpack explosion in Oviedo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has died and another
OL,7,Fhas been injured after a backpack
OL,8,Fexploded in the northern Spanish city
OL,9,Fof Oviedo.
OL,11,FThe explosion happened when officers
OL,12,Ffrom Spain's canine unit and explosives
OL,13,Fdisposal unit arrived and examined a
OL,14,Fsuspicious backpack following reports
OL,15,Fof a dispute between neighbours on
OL,16,FTuesday morning.
OL,18,FA woman was shot during the dispute and
OL,19,Fthe suspect is still at large, police
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
